Maintenance
-----------

When .claude/rules/vendored-files.md gains or loses an entry, update this file
in the same commit -- it is the fourth copy of that list, alongside the rule's
`paths:` frontmatter, .codacy.yml `exclude_paths`, and `[tool.bandit]`
`exclude_dirs` in pyproject.toml. Establish a license from the upstream
repository, never by assuming it matches a sibling entry.
